---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'en';
const pageTitle = 'About Me';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} locale={locale} description="Learn more about Fabienne Meyer – Swiss hyperrealistic charcoal artist based in Zurich.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero__inner">
      <div class="about-hero__text">
        <span class="about-hero__label">FabulousArt</span>
        <h1 class="about-hero__title">
          <span>Thoughtful</span>
          <span>Emotional </span>
          <span>Breathtaking</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="about-hero__image">
        <img src="/images/about/fabi.png" alt="Fabienne Meyer – Hyperrealistic charcoal artist" width="560" height="700" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bio -->
  <section class="about-bio section fade-in">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h2 class="about-bio__heading">Fabienne Meyer</h2>
      <p class="about-bio__subheading">Hyperrealistic Drawing - Extracting the brightest light from the deepest charcoal</p>

      <div class="about-bio__text">
        <p>
         As a Zurich-based artist behind FABulousART, I use the precision of hyperrealism to  explore the many facets of human existence. My charcoal drawings are more than just  images; they are invitations into emotional worlds, creating a profound bridge  between the artwork and you, the viewer.  What defines my work is the play  of extremes: using the inherently dark medium of charcoal, I create radiant  light and flawless shades of white.
        </p>
        <p>
          For me, art is the ultimate expression of my freedom. My pieces are not meant to be merely aesthetically captivating; they serve as catalysts for reflection and dialogue. I invite viewers to immerse themselves in these evocative worlds and to find their own life experiences reflected within my stories.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Education & Career -->
  <section class="about-career section fade-in">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h3 class="about-career__heading">Education and Career</h3>
      <p class="about-career__text">
        For as long as I can remember, pencil and paper have been my constant companions.  Yet, my path to art wasn't a traditional one – it has been shaped by a spirit of discovery  and a deep love for detail
      </p>
      <br />
      <p class="about-career__text">
        With a background as a florist, I learned not just to look at the delicate  structures of nature, but to truly understand them. This fascination with the perfection  found in detail is something I carried over into my art. As a self-taught artist, I have spent  years teaching myself and refining the techniques of hyperrealism.
      </p>
      <br />
      <p class="about-career__text">
       Today, black charcoal is my medium of choice. I am fascinated by how such a raw material  can create almost lifelike works through the interplay of light and shadow. What began with  my first exhibitions in 2020 has since taken me on an international journey – yet the heart  of my work remains the same: capturing the quiet perfection of a single moment on paper.
      </p>
      <br />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="about-cta section fade-in">
    <div class="container container--narrow" style="text-align: center;">
      <p class="about-cta__text">Interested in a custom drawing?</p>
      <a href="/en/custom-drawing" class="btn">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <section class="about-testimonials section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="about-testimonials__title">Testimonials</h2>

      <div class="about-testimonials__grid">
        <div class="testimonial-card fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
          <p class="testimonial-card__text">
            "Thank you many times, the picture and work you provide is mesmerizing and unique. I'm so happy
            that I came to you with my request."
          </p>
          <div class="testimonial-card__author">
            <div class="testimonial-card__avatar">K</div>
            <div>
              <p class="testimonial-card__name">Karim Moutiq</p>
              <p class="testimonial-card__role">Cloud Engineer</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="testimonial-card fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <p class="testimonial-card__text">
            "The Custom Drawing I ordered was fantastic, she implemented my suggestions perfectly and she is a fast worker."
          </p>
          <div class="testimonial-card__author">
            <div class="testimonial-card__avatar">I</div>
            <div>
              <p class="testimonial-card__name">Ian Schneider</p>
              <p class="testimonial-card__role">Police Officer</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="testimonial-card fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
          <p class="testimonial-card__text">
            "Many thanks to Fabulous Art! I was worried in the beginning but stunned by the result. I cannot
            express how happy I am with the drawing in the end!"
          </p>
          <div class="testimonial-card__author">
            <div class="testimonial-card__avatar">F</div>
            <div>
              <p class="testimonial-card__name">Florence Polla</p>
              <p class="testimonial-card__role">Customer</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ---- Hero ---- */
  .about-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + var(--space-3xl));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4xl);
    background: var(--color-gray-50);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .about-hero__label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-hero__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about-hero__title span {
    display: block;
  }

  .about-hero__image {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about-hero__image img {
    max-height: 580px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  /* ---- Bio ---- */
  .about-bio {
    padding-top: var(--space-5xl);
  }

  .about-bio__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .about-bio__subheading {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .about-bio__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-bio__text p {
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  /* ---- Career ---- */
  .about-career {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-career__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .about-career__text {
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  /* ---- CTA ---- */
  .about-cta {
    background: var(--color-gray-50);
  }

  .about-cta__text {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: none;
  }

  /* ---- Testimonials ---- */
  .about-testimonials__title {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .about-testimonials__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .testimonial-card {
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-base), box-shadow var(--transition-base);
  }

  .testimonial-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-gray-400);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .testimonial-card__text {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-gray-600);
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-style: italic;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .testimonial-card__author {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .testimonial-card__avatar {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-black);
    color: var(--color-white);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 500;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .testimonial-card__name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    max-width: none;
  }

  .testimonial-card__role {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    max-width: none;
  }

  /* ---- Responsive ---- */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about-testimonials__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
      gap: var(--space-2xl);
    }

    .about-hero__image img {
      max-height: 420px;
    }

    .about-hero {
      padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + var(--space-2xl));
      padding-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
    }
  }
</style>
